{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42033","headline":"江次维舟登古寺 · 李中","name":"江次维舟登古寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"辍櫂因过古梵宫，荒凉门径鏁苔茸。\n绿阴满地前朝树，清韵含风後殿钟。\n童子纵慵眠坏榻，老僧耽话指诸峰。\n吟余却返来时路，回首盘桓尚驻筇。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李中","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42033.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42033","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}